  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to flood affected people in Mandalay</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In Pyaw Bwe Township, approximately 5,000 small holder farmers are seriously affected by floods, and at least 90% of their plantations (average 3,0000 acres) were destroyed under flood disaster. 
At least 1,000 landless women labourers lost their job opportunities and are not having income even for their survival.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will reach out to 250 (at least 30% women headed households) small holder farmers (1250 acres) to restore plantations immediately and 150 landless farm workers households (50% women) for survival jobs through labour vouchers.</narrative>
  </description>
